DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     iillooggbb(), iillooggbbff() and iillooggbbll() return _x's exponent in integer format.
     iillooggbb(_±_∞) returns INT_MAX, iillooggbb(_±_N_a_N) returns FP_ILOGBNAN, and iillooggbb(_0)
     returns FP_ILOGB0.

     llooggbb(_x), llooggbbff(_x), and llooggbbll(_x) return _x's exponent in floating-point
     format with the same precision as _x.  llooggbb(_±_∞) returns +∞, and llooggbb(_0)
     returns -∞ with a division by zero exception.

